5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm going to find that werewolf and protect everyone, so just watch me! Does anyone have a plan for how we should handle the voting?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"It is a bit early for a concrete plan, Takumi. I believe it is best to observe everyone's behavior and listen carefully to the discussions first. Let us remain calm and patient.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with George! Let's all get to know each other first. I'm so excited to play with you all! I'll do my best to help the village, so let's have fun!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with George. Since we have no information yet, it's best to observe and look for contradictions in our statements as the game progresses. Let's keep things logical.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'm going to use my super-detective skills to find the werewolf and save the village! Let's all do our best!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, super-detective skills, huh? I like the spirit! But we can't just guess. We need to be smart about this if we're going to win. I'll be keeping a very close eye on everyone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Observation is indeed the key, Takumi. However, let us be careful not to let our enthusiasm cloud our judgment. A steady hand and a clear mind will serve us better than haste.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"George is right! We should be careful not to rush into things. But I think it's okay to be excited, right? Let's just be kind to each other while we figure this out!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Kindness is fine, Yumi, but we shouldn't let it distract us. We need to be vigilant. If we are too lenient, the werewolf will find it much easier to deceive us.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, you're so serious! But I can be vigilant and cheerful at the same time! I'll be watching everyone's faces really, really closely to see if anyone looks like they're hiding a secret!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, I'm not being lenient, I'm just ready to fight! I'll be the one to spot the lies. Since we're just observing today, I'm going to focus on who's trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"Focusing on those who blend in is one way, Takumi, but remember that the most unassuming person can often be the most dangerous. I shall continue to observe from a distance.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That's a bit scary, George! But I trust all of you! I'll just keep smiling and helping everyone stay positive. I'm sure we can find the werewolf if we all work together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford right now, Yumi. We should focus on the facts and the logic of the arguments rather than feelings. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in how people respond.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, don't be scared! I'll protect you with my detective powers! @Misaki, logic is okay, but sometimes your tummy just tells you who the bad guy is! I'm going to trust my tummy and my eyes!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Tummy feelings aren't enough, Rin! But I've got this. I'm not letting any werewolf slip past me. Let's just get through today and see what happens tomorrow. I'm ready!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a reasonable approach for the first day. I shall now step back and reflect on our initial interactions.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I've had so much fun talking with everyone! I'm really looking forward to seeing what happens tomorrow. Let's all get some good rest!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's see what information the Seer provides tomorrow. I'll be observing everyone's reactions carefully.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Me too! I'm going to dream about clues and magnifying glasses! Goodnight everyone, and I'll see you tomorrow for more detective work!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
