36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, the first night is over! I've got some information to share. George, I checked you out, and you're human. That's one person we can trust for now! Who else thinks they've spotted something?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"@Takumi, thank you for the information. While I appreciate you clearing my name, I must ask: are you claiming to be the Seer? It is a bold move to reveal your role so early in the game.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, Takumi! You're already finding clues? That's so cool! If you're the Seer, that's a huge help for the village! I'm so glad George is safe, it makes me feel much better!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role on day one is a high-risk strategy. If you are telling the truth, it's helpful, but if you're the werewolf, you're trying to gain trust quickly. We should be cautious.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Whoa! Takumi is the Seer! That's so exciting! Does that mean you have a magic crystal ball or something? @Misaki, don't be so grumpy! I think it's awesome that we already know George is a good guy!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, I'm not trying to trick anyone! I'm the Seer, and I'm not afraid to lead the way. If I stay hidden, the werewolf just has more time to kill us. I'm doing this to protect everyone!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"Your confidence is admirable, Takumi, but bravery without caution can be reckless. If you are indeed the Seer, you have now made yourself the primary target for the werewolf. I will trust your word for now, but we must remain vigilant.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with George! Takumi, please be careful! It would be so sad if the werewolf attacked you just because you were trying to help us. We have to protect our Seer!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, your desire to protect us is noted, but the risk remains. If you are the werewolf, you've just secured George's trust and potentially ours. We should consider if this is too convenient.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, you're always thinking about the scary stuff! But look at Takumi, he's so confident! I think he's really the Seer. If he's lying, he's a very brave werewolf, but I bet he's just being a hero!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, stop overthinking it! I'm not some sneaky werewolf; I'm the one who's going to win this for us! If you're so worried, then help me find the real bad guy instead of just doubting me!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi, there is no need for frustration. Misaki's skepticism is a natural part of this game's logic. If you are the Seer, the most helpful thing you can do now is provide a clear direction for our vote. Who do you suspect?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, that's a great point! @Takumi, since you're the Seer, do you have any other feelings or clues? I really want to help you find the werewolf so we can all be safe together!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I am not doubting for the sake of it, but for the safety of the village. However, if we are to follow Takumi's lead, he should be the one to point us toward a suspect. @Takumi, who do you suspect?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Yeah, yeah! @Takumi, tell us! Who's the bad guy? My tummy is tingling, so I bet you've got a really good clue! Is it someone who's being too quiet, or maybe someone who's being too grumpy? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I don't have a divination on anyone else yet, but I've been watching. @Misaki, your constant doubting is starting to look like a cover! I'm not 100% sure, but you're the most suspicious right now. Let's vote Misaki!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"@Takumi, that is a very sudden leap. To move from a lack of divination to an accusation based solely on skepticism is a dangerous precedent. We must not execute a villager simply because they are cautious.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Wait, @Takumi, are you sure? Misaki is just being careful, and I think that's actually helpful! I don't want us to make a mistake and hurt someone innocent. Maybe we should think about this a bit more?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, accusing me simply because I'm questioning your strategy is illogical. If you are the Seer, you should rely on your divination, not on who you find annoying. This looks more like a desperate attempt to deflect suspicion.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Wait, wait! @Takumi, you can't just pick Misaki because she's grumpy! That's not how detective work works! My tummy says we should be careful. If we vote the wrong person, the werewolf wins! Are you really sure, or are you just guessing?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
