69,2,1,talk,George,,"It appears we have a tragedy on our hands. Misaki has been executed, and Takumi has been attacked. This sequence of events is quite telling. If Takumi were the werewolf, he would not have targeted himself.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! I can't believe this! Poor Takumi... he was trying so hard to protect us, and now he's gone! This is just terrible! I'm so sad that we lost two people in one day.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Nooo! Takumi is gone! He was our hero Seer! This is so scary! The werewolf is really mean for doing that! @George, you're right, Takumi wouldn't hurt himself, so he must have been the real Seer! Now what do we do?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,George,,"We are now in a precarious position. With Takumi gone, we have lost our only source of confirmed information. We must now rely on our own observations of Yumi and Rin to identify the werewolf.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"I know, it's so scary now! I'm really worried... @George, you're so calm, please help us! I'll do whatever it takes to find the werewolf, but I'm just a regular villager, so I'm not sure what to look for!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm a regular villager too, but I'm still a super-detective! @George, you're the smartest person left, so you have to lead us! Do you think the werewolf is pretending to be nice, or maybe they're just hiding in plain sight?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,George,,"It is a heavy burden to lead, but I shall do my best. Yumi, Rin, please remain focused. The werewolf is among us, and they may be using kindness or excitement as a shield. I must examine your behavior carefully.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'll be as honest as I can, George! I'm just so heartbroken about Takumi. I really want us to win, so please tell me if I'm doing anything suspicious. I'll follow your lead because I trust you!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm being honest too! I'm not a mean werewolf, I'm a helper! @George, since you're the leader now, do you have any super-secret clues? My tummy is still tingling, but I can't tell if it's because I'm scared or because the werewolf is right here!","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,George,,"I have no secret clues, Rin, only the evidence of our interactions. Yumi, your trust is appreciated, but we must be cautious. If the werewolf is among you two, they will likely try to appear as the most helpful. I shall cast my vote based on who seems most unnatural.","{""words"":50,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"That's so scary, George! I don't want to seem unnatural, I'm just really worried about all of us. I'll be completely open with you! Please, let's just work together so we can finally catch the werewolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@George, that sounds like a big job! I'll be as natural as a little bird! But wait, if the werewolf is pretending to be nice, does that mean Yumi is suspicious? No, she's too sweet! I'll keep my eyes wide open!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
